  "answer_text": "Here's some information about **\"Still in Love with You\"** by **Brooks & Dunn**:\n\n- **\"Still in Love with You\"** is the tenth track on Brooks & Dunn's album *Brand New Man*.\n\n- The song was released in **1991**.\n\n- It was **written and composed by Don Cook, Kix Brooks, and Ronnie Dunn**, and has a runtime of **3:34**.\n\nThe song is a classic country heartbreak tune about a person leaving a relationship but being unable to shake their feelings. The chorus features the memorable line about waking up \"still in love with you,\" no matter how far they try to run or dream.\n\nYou can find it on streaming platforms like **Spotify**, **Deezer**, and **YouTube**. Would you like to know anything else about this song or Brooks & Dunn?",
